{"seq":4,"slug":"intertemporal-choice","title":"跨期选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/intertemporal-choice","wordCount":1815,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨期选择\">跨期选择</h1><p>1937 年，保罗·萨缪尔森在《Review of Economic Studies》发表了一篇六页短文 &quot;A Note on Measurement of Utility&quot;。文中他顺手写下一个假设：人们对不同时点的效用按固定比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 逐期打折。这个本为方便而设的单参数贴现模型，此后统治了经济学半个多世纪。但萨缪尔森自己在文中就警告：他没有证据表明人真的这样贴现，等待实证检验。检验结果——他是对的，人是这样<strong>不</strong>贴现的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨期选择研究在不同时间点的成本与收益之间做权衡。指数贴现模型（Samuelson, 1937）假设贴现率恒定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msup><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(c_0, c_1, \\ldots, c_T) = \\sum_{t=0}^{T} \\delta^{t}\\, u(c_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>恒定贴现率有一个强推论：<strong>偏好随时间推移保持一致</strong>。今天你宁愿等一年多拿 100 元，那么一个月后你面对同样的选择仍应愿意等。实验与生活都否定了这一点：人们今天选&quot;明天拿 50 元&quot;，到了明天却愿意为&quot;再等一天&quot;索要远高于 100 元的补偿。这种&quot;计划时耐心、执行时急躁&quot;的现象称为<strong>现时偏差</strong>（present bias），其标准数学刻画是双曲贴现及其简化版 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>异常现象</th>\n<th>指数模型预测</th>\n<th>实际观察</th>\n<th>出处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隐含贴现率随延迟变化</td>\n<td>单一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，不随期限变</td>\n<td>一个月延迟隐含年率高达百分之几百，十年期降到 20% 以下</td>\n<td>Thaler, 1981, <em>EI</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额效应</td>\n<td>贴现率与金额无关</td>\n<td>大额收益隐含贴现率系统性更低</td>\n<td>Benzion 等, 1989, <em>MS</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>得失不对称</td>\n<td>得失对称</td>\n<td>提前到账愿付的代价低于延迟到账索要的补偿</td>\n<td>损失厌恶的时间投影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏好一致性</td>\n<td>计划即执行</td>\n<td>承诺健身后出勤率持续下滑</td>\n<td>DellaVigna &amp; Malmendier, 2006, <em>QJE</em></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[跨期决策] --&gt; B{贴现函数形状?}&#10;    B --&gt;|指数: 恒定贴现率| C[偏好时间一致&lt;br/&gt;计划=执行]&#10;    B --&gt;|双曲: 近期陡峭远期平缓| D[偏好时间不一致]&#10;    D --&gt; E[计划自我: 明年开始存钱]&#10;    D --&gt; F[执行自我: 今天先花掉]&#10;    E --&gt; G[两个自我的战争]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{解法}&#10;    H --&gt; I[承诺装置: 自动扣款/不可撤销存款]&#10;    H --&gt; J[默认设计: Save More Tomorrow]&#10;    H --&gt; K[缩短反馈: 立即奖励替代品]\">graph TD\n    A[跨期决策] --&gt; B{贴现函数形状?}\n    B --&gt;|指数: 恒定贴现率| C[偏好时间一致&lt;br/&gt;计划=执行]\n    B --&gt;|双曲: 近期陡峭远期平缓| D[偏好时间不一致]\n    D --&gt; E[计划自我: 明年开始存钱]\n    D --&gt; F[执行自我: 今天先花掉]\n    E --&gt; G[两个自我的战争]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{解法}\n    H --&gt; I[承诺装置: 自动扣款/不可撤销存款]\n    H --&gt; J[默认设计: Save More Tomorrow]\n    H --&gt; K[缩短反馈: 立即奖励替代品]</pre><h2 id=\"指数贴现的三组异常证据\">指数贴现的三组异常证据</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>贴现率随延迟长度递减</strong>：Thaler（1981, <em>Economic Inquiry</em>）问被试&quot;现在拿 15 元 vs 一段时间后拿多少才肯等&quot;，发现隐含年化贴现率在短延迟下高得离谱（一个月的延迟动辄隐含百分之几百的年率），十年延迟则降到 20% 以下；Benzion、Rapoport 与 Yagil（1989, <em>Management Science</em>）用更大的样本复现了同一模式。指数模型的单一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 完全无法拟合这种量级落差；</li>\n<li><strong>金额效应</strong>：大额收益的隐含贴现率显著低于小额——为等 100 元要高息，为等 10 万元可以低息。理性套利下贴现率不应随金额系统性变化；</li>\n<li><strong>得失不对称</strong>：对&quot;晚到账&quot;要求的补偿高于对&quot;提前到账&quot;愿意支付的代价——又是损失厌恶在时间维度上的投影（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的定义见<a href=\"loss-aversion-and-risk-attitude\">损失厌恶与风险态度</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"双曲贴现与-模型\">双曲贴现与 β-δ 模型</h2><p>双曲贴现把贴现函数从指数换成双曲形 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(t) = \\frac{1}{1+kt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>：近期贴现陡峭、远期平缓，恰好拟合三组异常。Laibson（1997, <em>Quarterly Journal of Economics</em>，&quot;Golden Eggs and Hyperbolic Discounting&quot;）把它简化成便于经济学分析的两参数形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msup><mi>δ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = u(c_0) + \\beta \\sum_{t=1}^{T} \\delta^{t} u(c_t), \\quad 0 &lt; \\beta \\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8436em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是常规的长期耐心，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 刻画&quot;对&#39;现在&#39;的特殊折扣&quot;。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，同一个体在不同时点拥有不同的偏好排序——Strotz（1955, <em>Review of Economic Studies</em>）早已指出这意味着<strong>动态不一致</strong>：今天的&quot;最优计划&quot;会被明天的自己推翻。拖延、健身卡闲置、储蓄不足，都是执行自我对计划自我的胜利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺装置-花掉选择权买一致性\">承诺装置：花掉选择权买一致性</h2><p>既然两个自我会打架，聪明的办法是提前捆住未来的手——承诺装置（commitment device）。Ariely 与 Wertenbroch（2002, <em>Psychological Science</em>）在 MIT 的课程实验中比较三种交稿安排：全部期末一次交、外部规定的分段截止日、学生自选的分段截止日。自选截止日的成绩介于两者之间——学生会给自己设置约束（说明他们预见到自己的拖延），但约束松于外部的强制安排（说明预见得不够）。这个实验同时证明了现时偏差的存在与承诺的价值边界。</p>\n<p>更早的理论基础由 Thaler 与 Shefrin（1981, <em>Economic Inquiry</em>）给出：&quot;计划者-执行者&quot;两自我模型把跨期冲突内生化——计划者像委托人，执行者像只关心当下的代理人，制度（账户隔离、规则）就是计划者管住执行者的工具。</p>\n<h3 id=\"健身房里的现时偏差\">健身房里的现时偏差</h3><p>健身房数据把这套逻辑放进了真实账本。DellaVigna 与 Malmendier（2006, <em>Quarterly Journal of Economics</em>）分析了近 8000 名健身房会员的出勤记录：包月会员（月费约 70 美元）平均每月只去约 4 次，单次成本远高于按次付费（约 10 美元/次）；更说明问题的是，会员在签约时<strong>高估了自己的出勤率</strong>，且在停止使用后平均还拖了两个多月才取消——现时偏差的三段式表演：签约时过度乐观、使用时偷懒、取消时拖延。健身房的商业模型正是围绕这三段设计的：把销售话术押在&quot;计划自我&quot;上，把利润押在&quot;执行自我&quot;上。</p>\n<p>对抗拖延的结构化思路由此清晰：把未来的行动变成今天的默认（预约制优于&quot;有空就去&quot;）、把奖励与惩罚前置（押金制、打卡返还）、把大目标切成带外部截止日期的小块（Ariely 与 Wertenbroch 的分段交稿实验）。每一招都在替&quot;计划自我&quot;预支&quot;执行自我&quot;的让步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从理论到大政策-save-more-tomorrow\">从理论到大政策：Save More Tomorrow</h2><p>Benartzi 与 Thaler 的短视损失厌恶解释了人们为什么存不下钱之后，Thaler 与 Benartzi（2004, <em>Journal of Political Economy</em>）设计了针对性的干预：Save More Tomorrow（SMarT 计划）。要点有三——员工<strong>预先</strong>承诺把未来加薪的一部分转入养老金（加薪未到手时承诺，损失感为零）；每次加薪自动提高缴存比例；随时可退出。第一家公司试点：78% 的员工加入；约四年间，参与者的缴存率从 3.5% 升至 13.6%，翻了近四倍；退出者寥寥。它后来成为美国《2006 年养老金保护法》中自动加入条款的原型，也是行为科学进入联邦立法的标志性案例（政策扩散见<a href=\"../behavioral-economics-applications/behavioral-public-policy\">行为公共政策</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>恒定贴现率是 1937 年的便利假设，被三组异常证据否定：贴现率随延迟递减、随金额递减、得失不对称</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 模型用两个参数刻画&quot;计划耐心、执行急躁&quot;，动态不一致是它的直接推论</li>\n<li>承诺装置有效但有价：MIT 实验显示自选约束弱于强制约束</li>\n<li>SMarT 计划证明：把储蓄决定放在加薪之前，绕开损失厌恶，参与率与缴存率双双翻倍</li>\n<li>跨期问题与心理账户互锁——&quot;现在的钱&quot;与&quot;未来的钱&quot;本来就是两个账户，见<a href=\"mental-accounting\">心理账户</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨期选择","id":"跨期选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"指数贴现的三组异常证据","id":"指数贴现的三组异常证据"},{"level":2,"text":"双曲贴现与 β-δ 模型","id":"双曲贴现与-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺装置：花掉选择权买一致性","id":"承诺装置-花掉选择权买一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"健身房里的现时偏差","id":"健身房里的现时偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"从理论到大政策：Save More Tomorrow","id":"从理论到大政策-save-more-tomorrow"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"心理账户","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/mental-accounting"},"next":{"title":"公平与互惠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/social-preferences/fairness-and-reciprocity"}}